Independent binary test oracle:
sdk/src/test/resources/oracle.tsv records wire digests produced by OVH's
kmip-go v0.9.2 (https://github.com/ovh/kmip-go), an independent implementation.
No OVH implementation source is included in the Java SDK. The oracle driver is
in tools/oracle, and uses the upstream Apache-2.0 licensed module.

Integration-only servers are fetched and built separately. Their code is not
linked into the SDK or distributed in its JAR:
- OpenKMIP/PyKMIP: Apache-2.0.
- pqctoday-org/pqctoday-hsm KMIP server: AGPL-3.0-only.
- OpenKCM Krypton: Apache-2.0. The lab bootstrap adapts its integration fixture;
  upstream copyright: SAP SE or an SAP affiliate company and Krypton contributors.
  Upstream source and its original license are fetched into the test image.

